{"id": 23410, "title": "A Happy Day", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "a-happy-day", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/23410_a-happy-day.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["我叫大伟，我是一个学生。现在我在中国学习汉语。我有一个好朋友，他叫马丁。我们都是大学生，我们也都很喜欢中国。我们喜欢吃中国菜。包子、饺子和面条都很好吃。我们也喜欢喝中国茶。今天星期六，我们都不上课。上午十点，我们去商场买衣服。下午我们去看电影。晚上我们自己做饭。今天我们非常高兴。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["我叫大偉，我是一個學生。現在我在中國學習漢語。我有一個好朋友，他叫馬丁。我們都是大學生，我們也都很喜歡中國。我們喜歡吃中國菜。包子、餃子和麵條都很好吃。我們也喜歡喝中國茶。今天星期六，我們都不上課。上午十點，我們去商場買衣服。下午我們去看電影。晚上我們自己做飯。今天我們非常高興。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["wǒ jiào Dà wěi， wǒ shì yī gè xué shēng。 xiàn zài wǒ zài Zhōng guó xué xí Hàn yǔ。 wǒ yǒu yī gè hǎo péng you， tā jiào Mǎ dīng。 wǒ men dōu shì dà xué shēng， wǒ men yě dōu hěn xǐ huan Zhōng guó。 wǒ men xǐ huan chī Zhōng guó cài。 bāo zi、 jiǎo zi hé miàn tiáo dōu hěn hǎo chī。 wǒ men yě xǐ huan hē Zhōng guó chá。 jīn tiān Xīng qī liù， wǒ men dōu bù shàng kè。 shàng wǔ shí diǎn， wǒ men qù shāng chǎng mǎi yī fu。 xià wǔ wǒ men qù kàn diàn yǐng。 wǎn shang wǒ men zì jǐ zuò fàn。 jīn tiān wǒ men fēi cháng gāo xìng。"], "english_paragraphs": ["My name is Dawei and I am a student. Now I am studying Chinese in China. I have a good friend named Martin. We are all college students, and we all like China. We like to eat Chinese food. The buns, dumplings and noodles are all delicious. We also like to drink Chinese tea. Today is Saturday, we don't have classes. At ten o'clock in the morning, we went to the mall to buy clothes. In the afternoon we went to see a movie. We cook our own meals in the evening. We are very happy today."], "english_full": "My name is Dawei and I am a student. Now I am studying Chinese in China. I have a good friend named Martin. We are all college students, and we all like China. We like to eat Chinese food. The buns, dumplings and noodles are all delicious. We also like to drink Chinese tea. Today is Saturday, we don't have classes. At ten o'clock in the morning, we went to the mall to buy clothes. In the afternoon we went to see a movie. We cook our own meals in the evening. We are very happy today.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiào\" data-defn=\"to be called\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">叫</span><span class=\"tr\">叫</span><rt>jiào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Dà wěi\" data-defn=\"David (name)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">大伟</span><span class=\"tr\">大偉</span><rt>Dà wěi</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shì\" data-defn=\"to be (followed by substantives only)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xué shēng\" data-defn=\"student / schoolchild\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">学生</span><span class=\"tr\">學生</span><rt>xué shēng</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiàn zài\" data-defn=\"now; at present; currently\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">现在</span><span class=\"tr\">現在</span><rt>xiàn zài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zài\" data-defn=\"(of sb or sth) to be (located) at\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"m